# The packed datasets and the trained networks are tracked, so the repository
# reproduces the paper on its own. Two things are not:
#
#  - 2peak/data/cstdata_35547/ holds the 35,547 raw per-sample exports the
#    bundle was packed from (539 MB, 35k files). The packed .npz is verified
#    against them, and nothing but pack_dataset.py reads them.
#  - the dataset generation logs, which served their purpose during the run.
2peak/data/cstdata_35547/
2peak/logs_dataset/

# A GroupNorm variant tried during development and not used in the paper.
2peak/norm_experiment/

# 600 dpi TIFF masters (175 MB) and their PNG previews are regenerated by the
# plotting scripts; the PDF and SVG of every figure are tracked.
*.tiff
*.png

# CST project directories: binary, machine-specific, and rebuilt by the
# generation scripts from the template.
Filter_CST_DataGen_Share/parallel_work/
Filter_CST_DataGen_Share/model2021/
Filter_CST_DataGen_Share/model2021_nk_model_multi_peaks/
Filter_CST_DataGen_Share/venv/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# IDE settings and a stray licence-daemon diagnostic: machine-specific,
# and nothing a reader of this archive needs.
.idea/
flex731.log
